# Gates the QAE verify job runs. Copy to the consumer as .vibe-verifier-qae. One per line: <gate> [args]
# The three input files are written by the verify job before the gate runs; the artifacts come from the explore job.
acceptance-verdict --criteria qae-inputs/pr-body.md --verdict qae-inputs/verdict.md --artifacts qae-artifacts
# The adjudicator: screenshots per step, console and network clean outside what this repo declares expected.
# Declare only what is environmental (for example an analytics script that only exists on the host platform).
# A refusal one pull request expects (an auth gate's 401) is declared in its criterion, `expected-refusal: 401 /path`, not here.
# --site-file is the URL the explore job's site step declared, local or a preview; --site <URL> fixes one instead.
qae-artifacts --artifacts qae-artifacts --criteria qae-inputs/pr-body.md --site-file qae-inputs/site-url
